    "body": "I don't think this update is a great idea. The definition in UI Events competes with the definition in HTML, and the definition in HTML seems better-maintained. (E.g.: UI Events says the event is always sync, always bubbles, never cancelable, always composed, which is not good; those things are per-call-site properties, not properties of the event definition.)",
    "created_at": "2021-06-07T17:55:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-07T17:55:44Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6743#discussion_r646820717",
